{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>2022年香港小姐「友誼小姐」得主、模特兒出身的無綫小花邢慧敏（Sharon），向來熱愛旅遊探索世界。早前她暫時放下工作，相約三位好姊妹一行四人飛赴度假勝地印尼峇里島展開慢活之旅。此行除了為自己慶祝生日，更是專程慶祝四人相識逾廿載的珍貴友誼。心情大靚的邢慧敏日前在社交平台大派福利，上載了一輯火辣的藍色比堅尼泳照，在泳池邊大展名模級的逆天長腿與纖細身段，瞬間引來大批網民瘋狂點讚。</p><figure><img alt=\"港姐邢慧敏峇里大解放！（IG@sharon.ying）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194597018916753408506328.jpeg/dO3wRDg-1W2B6rNjvLi2vhzdSZ7EAnZFUUw2WFFMNlg\"/><figcaption>港姐邢慧敏峇里大解放！（IG@sharon.ying）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"藍色比堅尼大曬超模九頭身。（IG@sharon.ying）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194597015695396864689134.jpeg/gW43GBgAe8BEg3kvpE7crLR5vi3MJSw3-ihsmPoobJg\"/><figcaption>藍色比堅尼大曬超模九頭身。（IG@sharon.ying）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大曬白嫩後背。（IG@sharon.ying）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194597012671172608890241.jpeg/Ae6ExxNkpMrMeUpSnZ4-tasm7gLt_A4r1RovGNUaLxg\"/><figcaption>大曬白嫩後背。（IG@sharon.ying）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"展超模「九頭身」。（IG@sharon.ying）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194597595981418496216890.jpeg/KlEevdhpe9gqq76MNvvlfIFMSWOq4-H7HqrfIB6q3yA\"/><figcaption>展超模「九頭身」。（IG@sharon.ying）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"邢慧敏。（IG@sharon.ying）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194597009592422400386495.jpeg/q-MgELJtxeWwnH5jVtXkDVqaKAx4V9USgrAdFYKwHRU\"/><figcaption>邢慧敏。（IG@sharon.ying）</figcaption></figure><p>比堅尼水著大派福利　海星髮夾點綴展超模「九頭身」</p><p>在社交平台分享的度假靚相中，邢慧敏身穿一襲亮藍色比堅尼，頭上巧妙夾著一枚精緻的海星髮夾，整體造型充滿夏日海洋風情，與池畔波光粼粼的景致絕配相襯。她悠閒地坐在泳池邊享受日光浴，興奮寫道：「泡在泳池邊的短暫假期，（海星髮夾終於派上用場了）。」本身擁有多年專業模特兒經驗的邢慧敏，身形比例一向得天獨厚。相中所見，她身段纖瘦毫無贅肉，一雙修長美腿與緊緻線條極為搶眼，「Fit到漏油」的完美狀態完全展現出「超模架勢」。</p><figure><img alt=\"比堅尼水著大派福利。（IG@sharon.ying）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194597592663592960375981.jpeg/2N6eoxoUK3SnDki0IZiOJnPgYe_E9p-vj6Vg-I-lYPg\"/><figcaption>比堅尼水著大派福利。（IG@sharon.ying）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T15:26:36.978873+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":576,"images":6,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T15:15:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T18:14:43.243355+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T15:19:31.220821+00:00","content_hash":"d38bab4ac3e373d1a5d2958d29058f8679f8cfd0d9f38d3a15ea933dd79e7ae0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}